  "collectionNotes": [
    "部分适配：真实ESP32-C6容量、精确总线、数字显示/复位及已列输入；完整应用、浏览器与实物尚未验收。",
    "原始厂家镜像保持原字节，镜像和分区校验通过；官方测试程序运行结果逐版本保留，不以CLI退出码代替成功。",
    "音频PCM、无线业务、模拟电源/充电/电池ADC、物理屏幕扫描/颜色及触摸配准仍未验收。",
    "3D保留厂家CAD或尺寸依据；UNKNOWN内部与推测厚度/排针不能用作装配尺寸。",
    "TF数字卡接口按此硬件版本接入；本次官方测试快照未插卡，不将无卡错误解释为无卡槽。",
    "官方测试最终快照 1 种RGB颜色。 详见native-stop-summaries及逐版本限制。",
    "官方Demo包内Test.bin已通过完整镜像校验，可按双SHA-256固定的zip-bundle路径加载；官方资料未明确其为出厂恢复固件，因此归官方测试示例trial。原程序在3.221客体秒触发BLE断言并复位，完整应用未通过。",
    "Physical part is ST7789V2; compatible BSP class naming does not change identity. Pinned official test source mirror(true,false) supplies fixed front reference; guest MADCTL remains active.",
    "Official test image is an exact member of the 97,520,767-byte, 6,092-entry Demo ZIP. The public zip-bundle source pins both archive and selected BIN hashes. No explicit factory-restoration purpose was found.",
    "Exact original image reaches a BLE assertion and resets after 3.221 emulated seconds; final backlight is off. Digital LCD, RGB and SD tests do not establish original full-app acceptance.",
    "Manufacturer STEP has 193 parts. It differs in several millimetre dimensions from the current dimension photograph; native geometry is not scaled. Header SKU adds illustrative pins at 12 exact native hole centres, with unknown pin length/section explicitly labelled."
  ]
